    "answer": {
      "short": "$55$. Multiply each numerator by the reciprocal of its denominator.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1}{1}+\\frac{2}{\\frac{1}{2}}+\\frac{3}{\\frac{1}{3}}+\\frac{4}{\\frac{1}{4}}+\\frac{5}{\\frac{1}{5}}&=1+2\\times2+3\\times3+4\\times4+5\\times5\\\\&=1+4+9+16+25\\\\&=55\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
